<!--
    HS321 VFD Modbus configuration for hm2_modbus / mesambccc
    
    Hardware:   HARS HS321 VFD (SD321/SD320 series)
    Bus:        RS485, 9600 baud, 8N1
    Slave addr: 5
    
    VFD setup required (set on keypad before use):
        F0.02 = 2  (run command source = serial comms)
        F0.03 = 8  (frequency source = serial comms)
    
    Register map (0-based Modbus addresses):
        Write 0x2000 (8192)  : run command
                               1 = forward run
                               2 = reverse run
                               3 = forward jog (10Hz)
                               4 = reverse jog (10Hz)
                               0 = stop
                               6 = decelerate to stop
                               7 = fault reset
        Write 0x1000 (4096)  : frequency setpoint
                               0-10000 = 0-100% of F0.08 max frequency
                               e.g. F0.08=300Hz, so 10000=300Hz=18000rpm (2-pole)
        Read  0x3000 (12288) : drive status (read-only)
                               1 = forward running
                               2 = reverse running
                               3 = stopped
        Read  0x7000 (28672) : set frequency (Hz x 10)
        Read  0x7001 (28673) : output voltage (V)  [confirm with motor]
        Read  0x7003 (28675) : output current (A x 10)  [confirm with motor]
        Read  0x7018 (28696) : shaft speed (RPM) - requires F9.03 set to rated RPM
        Read  0x0B03 (2819)  : current fault code
        Read  0x0B04 (2820)  : previous fault code
        Read  0x0B05 (2821)  : fault before previous
        Read  0x0B06 (2822)  : bus voltage at last fault (V)
        Read  0x0B07 (2823)  : current at last fault (A x 10)
        Read  0x0B08 (2824)  : set frequency at last fault (Hz x 10)
        Read  0x0B09 (2825)  : running frequency at last fault (Hz x 10)

    HAL pins created (prefix: hm2_modbus.0.hs321vfd.):
        Writes (in):
            cmd-run         HAL_U32  : run command word (1=fwd, 2=rev, 0=stop, 7=reset)
            freq-set        HAL_S32  : frequency setpoint (0-10000)
        Reads (out):
            status          HAL_U32  : drive status word
            freq-display    HAL_S32  : set frequency Hz x 10
            volts-out       HAL_U32  : output voltage V
            amps-out        HAL_S32  : output current A x 10
            rpm             HAL_U32  : shaft speed RPM
            fault-current   HAL_U32  : current fault code
            fault-prev1     HAL_U32  : previous fault code
            fault-prev2     HAL_U32  : fault before previous
            fault-voltage   HAL_U32  : bus voltage at last fault
            fault-amps      HAL_U32  : current at last fault
            fault-freq-set  HAL_U32  : set freq at last fault
            fault-freq-run  HAL_U32  : running freq at last fault
-->
